    "Needed to measure folders macOS protects, such as Mail, Messages and other apps' data. Stofi only reads them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nötig, um Ordner zu messen, die macOS schützt, etwa Mail, Nachrichten und Daten anderer Apps. Stofi liest sie nur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs Full Disk Access to be measured.": {
