          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When space is low": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei knappem Speicher"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Will be processed": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird verarbeitet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a scan, only known locations are measured. Scan the startup disk to also find old node_modules folders, large media and duplicates.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ohne Analyse werden nur bekannte Orte gemessen. Analysiere das Startvolume, um auch alte node_modules-Ordner, große Mediendateien und Duplikate zu finden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it, macOS hides some folders (for example Mail, Safari and other apps' data) from Stofi, so their size cannot be measured. Stofi only reads; it never changes files without asking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ohne ihn verbirgt macOS einige Ordner vor Stofi (z. B. Mail, Safari und Daten anderer Apps), sodass ihre Größe nicht gemessen werden kann. Stofi liest nur und ändert nie Dateien, ohne zu fragen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Xcode Archives": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Xcode-Archive"
          }
        }
      }
